                        ],
                        "form": "performative"
                    },
                    {
                        "form_id": "e95b2250-2e22-44db-916e-155d247b704e",
                        "entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural",
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "form": "performatives"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "0abaf72e-4205-30d6-8258-7065e651426b",
                        "entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui accomplit un acte, en parlant d'un énoncé (par opposition à constatif)."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "44bafa7b-095b-48ca-adaf-5d2176c784ce",
                                "sense_id": "0abaf72e-4205-30d6-8258-7065e651426b",
                                "text": "C’est le côté performatif des sondages : ils rendraient vrai ce qu’ils annoncent et « fabriqueraient » ainsi le scrutin, certains sondés penchant automatiquement vers le vainqueur du sondage précédent."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "449e9f22-1153-4250-b4c5-d934d4a3d4b2",
                                "sense_id": "0abaf72e-4205-30d6-8258-7065e651426b",
                                "text": "Les textes littéraires sont essentiellement de nature performative. Lorsque le poète américain T.S. Eliot nous dit, par exemple, « Avril est le mois le plus cruel », il ne cherche pas à décrire une réalité. Au contraire, avec les mots, il ouvre un espace où « avril » et sa « cruauté » se dévoilent devant nous pour créer un effet."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "3df658eb-7448-3570-b3c1-f282cd30c2c3",
                        "entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Qui voudrait, par un énoncé ronflant, accomplir quelque chose."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "ironic"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b7625a4a-199e-4730-b5d9-e4b7997b0799",
                                "sense_id": "3df658eb-7448-3570-b3c1-f282cd30c2c3",
                                "text": "On a cessé de voir fleurir des structures aux intitulés performatifs (« d'excellence » ou « de la réussite », le plus souvent)."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "feaf723f-f783-3411-a4b0-b4307dc0ed09",
                        "entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Performant, relatif aux performances."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "feb430ac-55fd-4c65-b1b4-a2eee92bc33c",
                                "sense_id": "feaf723f-f783-3411-a4b0-b4307dc0ed09",
                                "text": "L'activité théorique des sciences ne contredit aucunement leur nature performative."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "739e759b-1ccb-4bee-8e59-a45f49604186",
                                "sense_id": "feaf723f-f783-3411-a4b0-b4307dc0ed09",
                                "text": "Je vois beaucoup de salariés qui quittent leur entreprise pour mettre une ligne sur leur CV, dans un souci permanent de parcours performatif."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "0b39eec3-fb40-40de-a098-c809d37d21c2",
                        "source_entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "target_lang_word": "performativ",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "performativ",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "73177985-469a-3138-93d5-67f1f227de80",
                                        "entry_id": "cb5a1291-0697-3333-a068-fca6a4e86604",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "eine Sprechhandlung benennend, spezifizierend"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Sprachphilosophie"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "11da5325-9476-4da7-874e-cb9db9d96f53",
                                                "sense_id": "73177985-469a-3138-93d5-67f1f227de80",
                                                "text": "Performativ ist ein Begriff der Sprechakttheorie und wird auf solche Äußerungen angewendet, die die Sprecherintention benennen. Performativ ist zum Beispiel das Verb versprechen, das genutzt werden kann, um den Sprechakt des Versprechens explizit zu bezeichnen, etwa in Äußerungen wie: Hiermit verspreche ich dir, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a5a59f2-c5d2-4863-9c9c-17b267f2e025",
                                                "sense_id": "73177985-469a-3138-93d5-67f1f227de80",
                                                "text": "Ein Staatspräsident, der eine Chrysanthemenausstellung eröffnet, tut dies in einer performativen Äußerung: Er sagt vom Rednerpult, „Hiermit eröffne ich diese Ausstellung, […] “, und allein indem er sagt, dass er eröffne, eröffnet er auch schon."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dee0b3c8-7b56-4352-9450-d3cb8b8abd08",
                                                "sense_id": "73177985-469a-3138-93d5-67f1f227de80",
                                                "text": "„Hiermit gratulieren wir Dir herzlich zum Geburtstag!“ ist eine performative Äußerung."
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "31dfd6fd-8c1e-43ca-af67-aa2e5bc98a1b",
                        "source_entry_id": "3166257e-ad3e-3776-8c6c-ccb13b9a96fd",
                        "target_lang_word": "performative",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "performative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f76fc5c0-763a-394e-8276-8bb399dc6de2",
                                        "entry_id": "931961ba-7a34-3543-82ea-a832934bdc02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being enacted as it is said."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fa1d63c1-025c-48f3-a11e-c64dca9e62b8",
                                                "sense_id": "f76fc5c0-763a-394e-8276-8bb399dc6de2",
                                                "text": "Saying \"I do\" as part of a wedding ceremony is performative, enacting a marriage."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3813ed5a-ff21-46c7-96f1-ed2946475a70",
                                                "sense_id": "f76fc5c0-763a-394e-8276-8bb399dc6de2",
                                                "text": "Thus in the example: 'By saying “I do” I was marrying her', the performative 'I do' is a means to the end of marriage. Here 'saying' is used in the sense in which it takes inverted commas and is using words or language, a phatic and not[…]"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                        "entry_id": "931961ba-7a34-3543-82ea-a832934bdc02",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Being done as a performance in order to create an impression."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "f2893a03-9a2c-42b4-b1bf-75ccd1975cbc",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "We were beginning to suspect that her ethical qualms were sometimes performative, as the urgent need for fairness and justice seemed to apply to some people but not to others."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "8619468b-59b1-4e9e-aa02-59c55ddd5188",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "Although the seeming copycat nature of the plots in Port Huran and Conyers was terrifying because of their repetitive, performative, even texted nature—their seeming theatricality—more harrowing was the threat that, like theater, the performance would settle quickly into repetition compulsions in schools across the nation."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a2f94420-a1c8-405f-9cc6-9a6ef2629298",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "With the danger of science becoming purely “performative” (Lyotard 1984), not seeking any pretense of “truth” but simply performing a service for those in charge while still occupying its decision-making role in a technocratically dominated political sphere […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "49fc3787-a3bb-4a74-8c8a-bd63775f5c3a",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "The Harambe meme soon became the perfect parody of the sentimentality and absurd priorities of Western liberal performative politics and the online mass hysteria that often characterized it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33f78354-eeb5-49d6-a406-f7b38bc1fd9d",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "The reality of remote working has turned out to be different. Days have become longer and employees are demonstratively visible. Work has become more performative."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c59cadd5-4741-4c1a-bf08-dedf9930782e",
                                                "sense_id": "a4e1d3e8-5b42-318b-91e3-31a964b89f73",
                                                "text": "After the photos of Jenner and Elordi were published there was a stream of online discourse stating we had entered an era of performative reading."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "performative",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "d12e68a2-c3db-33d8-bf4d-68d300a4ae97",
                                        "entry_id": "ded4fa45-78fa-3dec-8596-7f59c563dcc1",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A performative utterance."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4274e960-a23e-4ad4-a258-4e0c3c937813",
                                                "sense_id": "d12e68a2-c3db-33d8-bf4d-68d300a4ae97",
                                                "text": "The distinction between constatives and performatives is one of the distinctions that he starts questioning."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
